<title>USA: Consolidated stake held by Vinik group.</title>
<headline>Consolidated stake held by Vinik group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by former Fidelity Magellan Fund manager Jeffery Vinik said Thursday it holds a 7.9 percent stake in Consolidated Graphics Inc or 980,300 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said the stake was bought between December 24, 1996 and February 19, 1997 at prices ranging from $25.75 to $32.3649 per share.</p>
<p>The group holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
